isional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p030","text":"二年，漢王東略地，塞王欣、翟王翳、河南王申陽皆降。韓王昌不聽，使韓信擊破之。於是置隴西、北地、上郡、渭南、河上、中地郡；關外置河南郡。更立韓太尉信為韓王。諸將以萬人若以一郡降者，封萬戶。繕治河上塞。諸故秦苑囿園池，皆令人得田之，正月，虜雍王弟章平。大赦罪人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"塞王欣","kind":"person","person_id":"o8z_o5j_2e8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"翟王翳","kind":"person","person_id":"3j2_4x7_nzr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"申陽","kind":"person","person_id":"x9l_eux_c3n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"韓王昌","kind":"person","person_id":"vxt_uj1_8ym","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"韓信","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0069","start":69,"end":73,"surface":"韓太尉信","kind":"person","person_id":"hm1_rqr_l9u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"韓王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"雍王","kind":"person","person_id":"4jv_qte_5p4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m030-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"章平","kind":"person","person_id":"fs1_3m9_rj3","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","so